"Turn off personalized ads" = "关闭个性化广告";
"Stops Apple using what you do in its apps to target ads in the App Store, News and Stocks." = "Apple 不再利用你在其 App 中的行为，在 App Store、新闻和股市中投放广告。";
"Turn off Improve Siri and Dictation" = "关闭“改进 Siri 与听写”";
"Stops Apple storing and reviewing recordings of your Siri and dictation requests." = "Apple 不再存储和审阅你的 Siri 与听写请求录音。";
"Turn off Improve Search" = "关闭“改进搜索”";
"Stops Apple keeping your Spotlight, Safari and Look Up searches to improve search." = "Apple 不再保留你在聚焦、Safari 和“查询”中的搜索来改进搜索。";
"Turn off Spotlight internet results" = "关闭聚焦的互联网结果";
"Keeps Spotlight searches on your Mac instead of sending them to Apple for web suggestions." = "聚焦搜索留在你的 Mac 上，而不会发送给 Apple 以获取网页建议。";
"Turn off Look Up suggestions" = "关闭“查询”建议";
"Stops Look Up sending the words you select to Apple for web results." = "“查询”不再把你选中的词语发送给 Apple 以获取网页结果。";
"Turn off Safari search suggestions" = "关闭 Safari 搜索建议";
"Stops Safari sending what you type in the address bar to your search engine and to Apple." = "Safari 不再把你在地址栏输入的内容发送给你的搜索引擎和 Apple。";
"The address bar no longer suggests searches as you type." = "地址栏在你输入时不再建议搜索。";
"Turn off Game Center" = "关闭游戏中心";
"Turns Game Center off, with its sign-in prompts, friend requests and notifications." = "关闭游戏中心，连同它的登录提示、好友请求和通知。";
"Games that need Game Center to save progress or play online lose that." = "需要游戏中心来保存进度或在线游玩的游戏会失去这项能力。";
"Stop clicks on the wallpaper hiding windows" = "点按墙纸时不再隐藏窗口";
"Stops every window sliding away when you click the wallpaper by mistake." = "误点墙纸时，窗口不再全部滑开。";
"Hide desktop widgets" = "隐藏桌面小组件";
"Hides widgets on the desktop, including in Stage Manager." = "隐藏桌面上的小组件，包括台前调度中的小组件。";
"Turn off the play, pause and skip keys" = "关闭播放、暂停和跳过键";
"Turns off the service behind the media keys, so the play key can't open Music." = "关闭媒体键背后的服务，使播放键无法打开“音乐”。";
"The keys stop working in every app, including VLC and Spotify. To keep them and only stop Music opening, use Stop Music from opening instead." = "这些键会在所有 App 中停止工作，包括 VLC 和 Spotify。若要保留按键、只阻止“音乐”打开，请改用“阻止音乐打开”。";
"Stop Music from opening, even by hand" = "阻止“音乐”打开，包括手动打开";
"Disables Music's application launch entry, so an AirPod press no longer opens it. No background helper or configuration profile is installed." = "停用“音乐”的启动项，使按下 AirPods 不再打开它。不会安装后台辅助程序或配置描述文件。";
"Music won't open at all, not even when you click it, until you undo this. Reapply after a macOS update replaces Music's files." = "在你撤销之前，“音乐”完全打不开，即使点按它也不行。macOS 更新替换了“音乐”的文件后，请重新应用。";
"Turn off iPhone Mirroring" = "关闭 iPhone 镜像";
"Turns iPhone Mirroring off, so the app and its prompts go away." = "关闭 iPhone 镜像，使该 App 及其提示消失。";
"Turn off Apple Music in the Music app" = "关闭“音乐”App 中的 Apple Music";
"Turns the Music app back into a plain player for your own library, without the store and subscription prompts." = "把“音乐”App 变回只播放你自己资料库的播放器，没有商店和订阅提示。";
"Apple Music subscribers lose streaming." = "Apple Music 订阅者将无法串流。";
"Turn off the Book Store" = "关闭 Book Store";
"Removes the store from the Books app and keeps your own books." = "从“图书”App 中移除商店，并保留你自己的图书。";
"Remove unused Apple apps from the Dock" = "从程序坞移除未使用的 Apple App";
"Removes News, TV, Music, Podcasts, Books, Freeform, Image Playground, Journal, Maps and Stocks from the Dock. The apps stay installed." = "从程序坞移除新闻、TV、音乐、播客、图书、无边记、Image Playground、手记、地图和股市。这些 App 仍保持安装。";
"Show file extensions" = "显示文件扩展名";
"Shows the full name of every file, so a file pretending to be a document is easier to spot." = "显示每个文件的完整名称，以便更容易发现伪装成文稿的文件。";
"Show hidden files" = "显示隐藏文件";
"Shows the files macOS hides, such as .gitignore and .zshrc. Press Command-Shift-Period to toggle it too." = "显示 macOS 隐藏的文件，例如 .gitignore 和 .zshrc。也可以按 Command-Shift-句点来切换。";
"Show the path bar" = "显示路径栏";
"Shows where the current folder is at the bottom of every Finder window." = "在每个访达窗口底部显示当前文件夹的位置。";
"Show the status bar" = "显示状态栏";
"Shows the number of items and the free space at the bottom of Finder windows." = "在访达窗口底部显示项目数量和可用空间。";
"Keep folders above files" = "文件夹排在文件上方";
"Keeps folders above files when sorting by name." = "按名称排序时，让文件夹排在文件上方。";
"Search the current folder" = "搜索当前文件夹";
"Makes Finder search the folder you're in, not the whole Mac." = "让访达搜索你所在的文件夹，而不是整台 Mac。";
"Skip the extension change warning" = "跳过更改扩展名的警告";
"Stops Finder asking for confirmation each time you change a file's extension." = "每次更改文件扩展名时，访达不再要求确认。";
"Show the full path in the title bar" = "在标题栏中显示完整路径";
"Shows the full folder path at the top of Finder windows." = "在访达窗口顶部显示文件夹的完整路径。";
"Stop .DS_Store files on network drives" = "不在网络驱动器上创建 .DS_Store";
"Stops Finder leaving .DS_Store files in shared folders on other computers." = "访达不再把 .DS_Store 文件留在其他电脑的共享文件夹中。";
"Empty the Trash after 30 days" = "30 天后清空废纸篓";
"Deletes items that have been in the Trash for 30 days, so it stops filling the disk." = "删除在废纸篓中存放了 30 天的项目，以免占满磁盘。";
"Save new documents on this Mac" = "将新文稿存储到这台 Mac";
"Makes Save dialogs start on your Mac instead of iCloud Drive." = "使存储对话框从你的 Mac 开始，而不是从 iCloud 云盘开始。";
"Expand Save dialogs" = "展开存储对话框";
"Opens Save dialogs with the full folder browser instead of the small version." = "打开存储对话框时使用完整的文件夹浏览器，而不是精简版。";
"Show the Library folder" = "显示资源库文件夹";
"Shows the hidden Library folder in your home folder." = "显示个人文件夹中隐藏的资源库文件夹。";
"Hide recent apps in the Dock" = "在程序坞中隐藏最近使用的 App";
"Stops the Dock adding apps you opened recently." = "程序坞不再添加你最近打开的 App。";
"Remove the Dock auto-hide delay" = "去掉程序坞自动隐藏的延迟";
"Shows a hidden Dock straight away instead of after half a second." = "隐藏的程序坞会立刻出现，而不是等半秒。";
"Stop Dock icons bouncing" = "停止程序坞图标弹跳";
"Stops Dock icons bouncing while apps open." = "App 打开时，程序坞图标不再弹跳。";
"Minimize windows into their app icon" = "将窗口最小化到其 App 图标中";
"Keeps minimized windows inside their app's icon instead of filling the Dock." = "最小化的窗口收进所属 App 的图标，而不是占满程序坞。";
"Turn off window opening animations" = "关闭窗口打开动画";
"Opens new windows instantly instead of zooming them in." = "新窗口会立刻打开，而不是放大进入。";
"Remove gaps between tiled windows" = "去掉平铺窗口之间的间隙";
"Removes the margins around windows you tile to the sides of the screen." = "去掉贴到屏幕两侧的窗口周围的边距。";
"Remove shadows from window screenshots" = "去掉窗口截屏的阴影";
"Takes window screenshots without the large drop shadow around them." = "截取窗口时不带周围的大投影。";
"Turn off autocorrect" = "关闭自动改正";
"Stops macOS correcting words as you type." = "输入时 macOS 不再改正单词。";
"Turn off smart quotes and dashes" = "关闭智能引号和破折号";
"Keeps straight quotes and double hyphens as you typed them, which code and terminals need." = "保留你输入的直引号和双连字符，代码和终端需要它们。";
"Turn off period on double space" = "关闭按两下空格插入句点";
"Stops two spaces turning into a period." = "两个空格不再变成句点。";
"Turn off automatic capitals" = "关闭自动大写";
"Stops macOS capitalizing the first word of each sentence." = "macOS 不再把每个句子的第一个词变成大写。";
"Repeat held keys instead of showing accents" = "按住按键时重复，而不是显示重音符号";
"Repeats a key while you hold it, instead of opening the accent menu." = "按住按键时重复该键，而不是打开重音符号菜单。";
"Type accents with Option shortcuts or the Character Viewer instead." = "请改用 Option 快捷键或字符检视器来输入重音符号。";
"Aerial wallpaper videos" = "航拍墙纸视频";
"Videos for the moving aerial wallpapers and screen savers. macOS downloads one again when you choose it." = "动态航拍墙纸和屏幕保护程序的视频。你再次选用时，macOS 会重新下载。";
"You use an aerial wallpaper or screen saver now, so macOS will download it again." = "你现在正在使用航拍墙纸或屏幕保护程序，因此 macOS 会重新下载它。";
"macOS installers" = "macOS 安装器";
"Old \"Install macOS\" apps left in Applications after an upgrade." = "升级后留在“应用程序”中的旧“安装 macOS”App。";
"iPhone and iPad updates" = "iPhone 和 iPad 更新";
"Software update files Finder downloaded for iPhones and iPads. They download again when needed." = "访达为 iPhone 和 iPad 下载的软件更新文件。需要时会重新下载。";
"Xcode build data" = "Xcode 构建数据";
"Xcode's DerivedData folder. Xcode rebuilds it on the next build." = "Xcode 的 DerivedData 文件夹。下次构建时 Xcode 会重新生成。";
"Xcode device support" = "Xcode 设备支持";
"Debug symbols Xcode copied from each iPhone, iPad and Watch you connected. They copy again on the next connection." = "Xcode 从你连接过的每台 iPhone、iPad 和 Watch 复制的调试符号。下次连接时会再次复制。";
"Unavailable simulators" = "不可用的模拟器";
"Simulators for runtimes that are no longer installed, so they can't run." = "对应的运行时已经不再安装，因此这些模拟器无法运行。";
"Deleted right away, not moved to the Trash." = "立即删除，不会移到废纸篓。";
"App caches" = "App 缓存";
"Files apps keep to load faster. Apps rebuild them, so the first launch afterwards can be slower." = "App 为了更快载入而保留的文件。App 会重新生成它们，因此之后第一次打开可能会更慢。";
"Quit your apps first. The macOS caches RemoveMacAI knows about are left alone." = "请先退出你的 App。RemoveMacAI 认识的 macOS 缓存不会被触碰。";
"One of Apple's optional apps. It reinstalls free from the App Store." = "Apple 的可选 App 之一。可以从 App Store 免费重新安装。";
"Time Machine local snapshots" = "时间机器本地快照";
"Hourly copies Time Machine keeps on this disk between backups. macOS counts them as System Data." = "时间机器在两次备份之间保留在这块磁盘上的每小时副本。macOS 把它们计为系统数据。";
"Deleted right away, not moved to the Trash. Your backups on the backup disk aren't touched." = "立即删除，不会移到废纸篓。备份磁盘上的备份不会被触碰。";
"1 snapshot" = "1 个快照";
"About %@. Items only an administrator can move ask for your password." = "约 %@。只有管理员才能移动的项目会要求输入密码。";
"%@ are deleted right away, not moved to the Trash." = "%@ 会立即删除，不会移到废纸篓。";
"Installed" = "已安装";
"Background item: %@" = "后台项目：%@";
"You see every change first" = "你会先看到每一项更改";
"Nothing happens until you review the list and click Apply." = "在你检查列表并点按“应用”之前，什么都不会发生。";
"Everything can be undone" = "一切都可以撤销";
"Undo puts every setting back. Deleted models download again when a feature needs them." = "“撤销”会恢复每项设置。已删除的模型会在功能需要时重新下载。";
"Your Mac stays protected" = "你的 Mac 仍然受到保护";
"System Integrity Protection stays on. Nothing inside /System is touched." = "系统完整性保护保持打开。/System 里面的内容不会被触碰。";
"Nothing leaves your Mac" = "没有任何东西离开你的 Mac";
"No account, no analytics, no network requests. The code is public on GitHub." = "没有账户，没有分析，没有网络请求。代码在 GitHub 上公开。";
"You review every change before it happens" = "每一项更改发生之前你都会检查";
"Undo puts everything back" = "“撤销”会把一切放回去";
"System Integrity Protection stays on" = "系统完整性保护保持打开";
"No network requests, no analytics" = "没有网络请求，没有分析";
"Wi-Fi" = "无线局域网";
"Bluetooth" = "蓝牙";
"Network" = "网络";
"Appearance" = "外观";
"Privacy & Security" = "隐私与安全性";
"I'll choose myself" = "我自己选";
"Start with nothing selected and pick from the sidebar." = "从没有选中任何内容开始，再从边栏里挑选。";
" and %@ of models" = "和 %@ 的模型";
"Nothing is selected for you" = "没有为你预先选择任何内容";
"Choose" = "选择";
"Pick a preset or switch single things off. Each one says what it does." = "选一套预设，或单独关闭某些项目。每一项都会说明它的作用。";
"Review" = "检查";
"You see the full list and how much space comes back. Nothing has changed yet." = "你会看到完整列表以及能收回多少空间。还没有任何更改。";
"Approve" = "批准";
"macOS asks you to install a profile in System Settings. Only you can make that click." = "macOS 会请你在系统设置中安装描述文件。那一下只能由你来点。";
"Debloats macOS and can undo every change.\n\nThe Apple Intelligence part builds on pared by 4evy, which first mapped Apple's asset service and model sets." = "为 macOS 减负，并且可以撤销每一项更改。\n\nApple 智能这部分基于 4evy 的 pared，它最先梳理了 Apple 的资源服务和模型集。";
"Could not write the profile: %@" = "无法写入描述文件：%@";
"The profile is still installed. Remove RemoveMacAI in System Settings > General > Device Management." = "描述文件仍已安装。请在系统设置 > 通用 > 设备管理中移除 RemoveMacAI。";
"The profile wasn't approved, so the locked settings and Apple Intelligence didn't change." = "描述文件未获批准，因此锁定的设置和 Apple 智能没有改变。";
"Apple's asset service didn't answer, so the models stay for now." = "Apple 的资源服务没有回应，因此模型暂时保留。";
"%@ stayed: %@" = "%1$@ 仍在：%2$@";
"not found on this version of macOS, so it was left alone" = "在这个 macOS 版本上找不到，因此未作改动";
"Removal couldn't be confirmed yet. Check again in a minute." = "暂时无法确认删除。请过一分钟再检查。";
"Moved %@ to the Trash. Empty the Trash to free the space." = "已将 %@ 移到废纸篓。清空废纸篓即可释放空间。";
"Deleted %@." = "已删除 %@。";
"1 item macOS protects stayed where it was." = "macOS 保护的 1 个项目留在了原处。";
"RemoveMacAI needs your password to change background items for all users." = "RemoveMacAI 需要你的密码，才能更改所有用户的后台项目。";
"RemoveMacAI needs your password to move items only an administrator can change." = "RemoveMacAI 需要你的密码，才能移动只有管理员才能更改的项目。";
"Turn off everything except 1 kept feature" = "关闭除保留的 1 项功能以外的所有内容";
